hs retain their own licenses.","assistance":"AI-assisted architectural interpretation and procedural recipe authoring; deterministic Python/Blender export. No photographic textures.","review":{"status":"pending","reviewer":null,"checks":{}},"modelingNotes":["The principal polygon and 15 m total roof height come from OSM. Its untagged roof rise is interpreted as 4 m from the inspected front and oblique Commons images; the shallow polygonal roof uses an 18 m inset.","Two-storey rear annex and uncovered service footprint use an explicitly inferred 7 m eave/8 m roof. The central lantern radius 2.8 m and 17.2 m crown are visual estimates relative to the mapped auditorium; its height is not surveyed.","Upper window band, corner pilasters and strong horizontal cornices retain the characteristic circus silhouette. Relief friezes, horses, lettering and ornamental colors are omitted; the shared restrained palette is used."],"source":{"url":"/objects/ec2958ec1bbee2ae6cc91fa98fe314d5736b10b6b54b59403fdc33bac3a8da74/source.blend.gz","bytes":139378,"sha256":"ec2958ec1bbee2ae6cc91fa98fe314d5736b10b6b54b59403fdc33bac3a8da74"},"spatialSource":{"url":"/objects/f6eb1c4cafa1d33940ad0a3185ed25fcb974fe09d27584838969ad53bca2508e/spatial-source.json","bytes":9044,"sha256":"f6eb1c4cafa1d33940ad0a3185ed25fcb974fe09d27584838969ad53bca2508e"},"preview":{"url":"/objects/9809e2576e5aecdec250efcdb5d0d8f25437115aa5abf6a9b089c337a93f58ed/preview.webp","bytes":4946,"sha256":"9809e2576e5aecdec250efcdb5d0d8f25437115aa5abf6a9b089c337a93f58ed"},"revision":"16b85f4b6d43a188f3eaa4d7f1fa28f0755b001c1c91687edc5e5dc2ef332d57","publicationRevision":"a7722bc938a08f21de78a9f86891b094e23e40e8e79222bd7409f3021cd043b0","bounds":[2.3671977,48.863145,2.3679858,48.8639277],"approved":false,"materialLibrary":{"schemaVersion":1,"sha256":"3b5a90bef8f8d24f4a3e0370016ca377b424f60119e8245e165cbcc5e7ea53ef","url":"/materials/3b5a90bef8f8d24f4a3e0370016ca377b424f60119e8245e165cbcc5e7ea53ef.json"},"metadata":"/assets/cirque-d